<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>目痛 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%9B%AE%E7%97%9B/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 09:46:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%9B%AE%E7%97%9B/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>形治法：论目痛 头痛 手痛 脚痛</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-30-xingzhifa/</link><pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 09:45:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-30-xingzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%9B%9B%E5%BE%A1%E9%9B%86/">卷四御集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“形治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;根据四肢头面等外在形体病症直接施治&lt;/strong&gt;的法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;病见之形象，何必求之于无形。审何经之病，用何经之药，引入病所，自然效应&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>常治法：论头疼 论目痛</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-22-changzhifa/</link><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 11:25:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-22-changzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“常治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;头疼与目痛&lt;/strong&gt;等常见病症以常法施治的原则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;常见之病，当以常法治之，不必动辄求奇求变。若常治不愈，再寻变法，不可本末倒置&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>偏治法：论治心痛 论上热下寒 论两胁胀满 论胃气痛脾不化食 论痿 论厥 论吐血 论治头痛腰背手足痛 论梦遗 喘嗽 口眼歪斜 目痛</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-11-pianzhifa/</link><pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 10:15:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-11-pianzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%80%E7%A4%BC%E9%9B%86/">卷一礼集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“偏治法”部分，论述&lt;strong&gt;不直接针对病变部位施治，而根据脏腑生克关系从他处入手&lt;/strong&gt;的独特治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;病在上治下，病在左治右，病在四肢治腹心，病在此脏而治彼脏&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>